        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Products: Now That's What I Call Music! 56 (U.S. series), 1989\n- Songs: \"Bad Blood\", \"See You Again\", \"Can't Feel My Face\"\n- People: Taylor Swift, Kendrick Lamar, Wiz Khalifa, Charlie Puth, The Weeknd\n- Concepts: Billboard Hot 100 number-one hits\n\nFacts:\n- In 2014, Taylor Swift released the song \"Bad Blood\" on her fifth studio album 1989.\n- Now That's What I Call Music! 56 (U.S. series) features 22 tracks.\n- Now That's What I Call Music! 56 (U.S. series) includes three Billboard Hot 100 number-one hits: \"See You Again\" by Wiz Khalifa featuring Charlie Puth, \"Can't Feel My Face\" by The Weeknd, and \"Bad Blood\" by Taylor Swift featuring Kendrick Lamar.",
